l\">サーモフィッシャーサイエンティフィックジャパングループ各社</a>は取得した個人情報を弊社の個人情報保護方針に従い利用し、安全かつ適切に管理します。詳細は<a href=\"/content/lifetech/japan/en-jp/home/global/privacy-policy.html\">個人情報の取扱いについて</a>をご確認ください。</p>\r\n","jcr:lastModified":"Tue May 24 2022 21:36:40 GMT-0400","sling:resourceType":"tfsite/components/text","textIsRich":"true"},"text_2052359522":{"jcr:primaryType":"nt:unstructured","jcr:createdBy":"mecuccc1","jcr:lastModifiedBy":"mecuccc1","jcr:created":"Tue May 24 2022 21:27:31 GMT-0400","text":"<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>イベント、製品／サービス、キャンペーン情報等のメール／テキストメッセージ配信・DM送付（※1）をご希望されますか？（※2）*</p>\r\n","jcr:lastModified":"Tue Jun 07 2022 15:46:56 GMT-0400","sling:resourceType":"tfsite/components/text","textIsRich":"true"},"options":{"jcr:primaryType":"nt:unstructured","jcr:createdBy":"mecuccc1","displayFrequentlyUsedCountries":"false","jcr:title":"最新製品情報やお得な情報のメール配信・DM送付をご希望されますか？","jcr:lastModifiedBy":"mecuccc1","source":"local","jcr:created":"Tue May 24 2022 21:29:26 GMT-0400","stripIsoFromState":"false","isoValFormat":"false","id":"form-options-field-820565251","name":"opt_in_email","type":"radio","jcr:lastModified":"Tue May 24 2022 21:31:36 GMT-0400","sling:resourceType":"tfsite/components/form/options","salesRegion":"EMEA","upperCaseValFormat":"false","dropdownType":"default","constraints":{"jcr:primaryType":"nt:unstructured","required":"true","hideTitle":"true","parentId":"form-options-field-820565251","sling:resourceType":"formcommons/components/common/constraints","inputTypeConstraint":"radio","requiredMessage":"どちらかをお選びください。"},"items":{"jcr:primaryType":"nt:unstructured","item0":{"jcr:primaryType":"nt:unstructured","text":"希望する、または既に受け取っている","value":"1","selected":"false"},"item1":{"jcr:primaryType":"nt:unstructured","text":"希望しない","value":"0","selected":"false"}}},"text_321876276":{"jcr:primaryType":"nt:unstructured","jcr:createdBy":"mecuccc1","jcr:lastModifiedBy":"mecuccc1","jcr:created":"Tue May 24 2022 21:35:37 GMT-0400","text":"<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>（※1） メール／テキストメッセージ配信・DM送付は、サーモフィッシャージャ